Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:51:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Read RML-IO source descriptions (rml:RelativePathSource,
 rml:FilePath)

A logical source whose rml:source is a source description of RML-IO, as in
every test case of the W3C KG-Construct CG,

    rml:source [ a rml:RelativePathSource ;
        rml:root rml:MappingDirectory ; rml:path "student.json" ]

was read as a file name: the label of the blank node (FileNotFoundError).

load_rml_graph now replaces such a description by the path it denotes,
resolved against its rml:root: the directory of the mapping file for
rml:MappingDirectory, the working directory for rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory
(the default), or the literal directory given. The logical source then has
a path literal, as in RML 1.0.

Fixes #407.
